From: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
Date: Mon, 8 May 2023 09:03:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: support scs feature

Smart Carrier Sense: a 1 Hz worker feeds per-band traffic and station
RSSI statistics to the firmware CCA adaptation algorithm. Enabled at
interface start; per-radio scs_enable debugfs knobs toggle it.

Signed-off-by: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
